# The build context for dashboard/Dockerfile is the repository root, and this
# file is an allowlist: the dashboard's own source and the OpenAPI document its
# type-drift test reads are the whole of what reaches the Docker daemon. .env,
# .git, Go sources, and build output never do.
*
!dashboard/
!api/openapi.yaml
dashboard/node_modules
dashboard/Dockerfile
dashboard/Dockerfile.dockerignore
